@model HabitFlow.Application.DatabaseDiagnostics?
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Diagnóstico PostgreSQL"; var code = Model?.ErrorCode ?? "postgres.ok"; }
<section class="hf-auth-grid"><div class="hf-auth-card"><p class="hf-section-kicker">Development/Admin</p><h1>Diagnóstico do PostgreSQL</h1><div class="hf-message @(Model?.Status == "healthy" ? "hf-message-success" : "hf-message-db")"><div class="hf-message-icon">i</div><div><strong class="hf-message-title">Status: @(Model?.Status ?? "unhealthy")</strong><div class="hf-message-body">@(Model?.ErrorMessage ?? "Conexão com PostgreSQL validada.")</div></div></div><dl class="row"><dt class="col-sm-4">Código</dt><dd class="col-sm-8">@code</dd><dt class="col-sm-4">Database</dt><dd class="col-sm-8">@(Model?.Database ?? "habitflow")</dd><dt class="col-sm-4">Username</dt><dd class="col-sm-8">configurado (mascarado)</dd><dt class="col-sm-4">Schema</dt><dd class="col-sm-8">habitflow</dd><dt class="col-sm-4">Tabelas obrigatórias</dt><dd class="col-sm-8">@(Model?.RequiredTablesOk == true ? "OK" : "verificar")</dd></dl><h2>Como corrigir</h2><ul><li>Abra appsettings.Development.local.json.</li><li>Confira Username e Password.</li><li>Teste com psql.</li><li>Execute database/script_completo.sql e database/validate_schema_habitflow.sql.</li><li>Reinicie a aplicação.</li></ul><code>dotnet run --project src/HabitFlow.Web</code></div><aside class="hf-auth-aside">@await Html.PartialAsync("~/Views/Shared/Partials/Illustrations/_DatabaseIssueIllustration.cshtml")<h2>@(code == "postgres.invalid_password" ? "Senha inválida para o usuário PostgreSQL configurado." : "Conexão e schema do HabitFlow")</h2><p>Use este painel apenas em Development ou como Admin.</p></aside></section>
